# Timiva SEO Rules

## Purpose

These rules define SEO, AEO, AI Search, FAQ, and internal linking behavior.

## Core principle

SEO supports the tool experience. SEO must not become the page's main experience.

Correct order:

```text
Tool App
Result
Related Tools
FAQ / SEO Content
Footer
```

Incorrect order:

```text
FAQ / SEO Content
Tool App
Result
Footer
```

## Required for each tool page

Each tool page should include:

```text
H1
Meta title
Meta description
Main tool area
Related Tools
FAQ
FAQ Schema / JSON-LD
Semantic HTML
```

## FAQ

FAQ should:

```text
Answer real user questions
Match visible page content
Stay concise
Use the correct language for the route
```

FAQ should not:

```text
Stuff keywords
Describe features that do not exist
Appear before the tool
Become long marketing copy
```

## Related Tools

Each tool page should recommend 2 to 4 related tools.

Prioritize:

```text
Same category tools
Complementary use cases
```

Do not overlink.

## Language

Do not mix English and Traditional Chinese content in the same localized page, except for official tool names when needed.

## Ads and SEO

Ads must not appear before the main result or inside the main tool flow.
